    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The Aga Khan University's Institute for the Study of Muslim Civilisations (AKU-ISMC) is pleased to announce the success of the second field school of Archaeology in Lahore Fort, Pakistan (16-31 October 2023). This unique project, launched in 2019 by Professor Stephane Pradines, has three main objectives based on research, education, and community participation.",
